{"id":"e2357908-2f29-434e-bf93-0fbcf6630bd6","title":"Pixel Party 4","slug":"pixel-party-4","collectionSlug":"pixel-party","collectionName":"Pixel Party","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A layered digital landscape featuring undulating mountain-like forms composed of particle fields and wave patterns. The composition uses a radial gradient base transitioning from white to light gray, creating atmospheric depth. Multiple overlapping sine waves create ridge-like formations with varying densities of small square particles that form the terrain. The particle field (40,000 particles) is rotated in 3D space (rotationX: 4°, rotationY: 82°, rotationZ: 94°) to create perspective depth. A gradient map applies a pastel color palette mapping luminance values to colors ranging from dark purple (#1a0b2e) through magenta (#e94560) to yellow (#f9ed69), creating a vibrant yet cohesive color scheme. The sine wave component adds rhythmic linear patterns with 0.5 softness, creating flowing contours across the terrain. A subtle glitch effect (intensity 0.5, RGB shift of 5 pixels) adds digital artifacts and chromatic aberration, particularly visible along the ridge edges. The overall effect creates an ethereal, three-dimensional topographic visualization with a cyberpunk aesthetic. The sky transitions from cyan-blue at the top to lighter turquoise, while the terrain displays purple, magenta, and yellow-green hues with dotted and lined particle textures creating visual complexity and depth.","colors":["#1a0b2e","#e94560","#f9ed69","#b5b5b5","#ffffff"],"labels":["gradient","organic","3d","calm"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/e2357908-2f29-434e-bf93-0fbcf6630bd6.jpg","toneMapping":"neutral","components":[{"type":"RadialGradient","id":"idmsw11cv7tgyiadwqf","_key":"key_msw11cv7tgyiadwqf","props":{"stops":[{"color":"#ffffff","position":0.005306897410358565},{"color":"#e0e0e0","position":1}],"aspect":1,"center":{"x":0.5,"y":1},"colorA":"#ff0000","colorB":"#0000ff","radius":